    <div class="card">
      <div class="transport-grid">
        <label class="transport-field"><span>上行合并大小 packetUp</span><input class="t" id="t-packetUp" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off"></label>
        <label class="transport-field"><span>下行聚合大小 packetDown</span><input class="t" id="t-packetDown" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off"></label>
        <label class="transport-field"><span>上传队列上限 packetQueue</span><input class="t" id="t-packetQueue" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off"></label>
        <label class="transport-field"><span>下行尾包阈值 packetTail</span><input class="t" id="t-packetTail" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off"></label>
        <label class="transport-field"><span>聚合等待 packetDelay (ms)</span><input class="t" id="t-packetDelay" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off"></label>
        <label class="transport-field"><span>竞速连接数 connectRace</span><input class="t" id="t-connectRace" type="text" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off"></label>
        <label class="transport-field"><span>首字节超时 firstByteTimeout (ms)</span><input class="t" id="t-firstByteTimeout" type="text" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off"></label>
      </div>
      <div class="row" style="margin-top:18px"><button class="btn primary" id="save-transport">保存参数</button><button class="btn" id="reset-transport">恢复默认</button><span class="transport-status" id="transport-status"></span></div>
      <div class="transport-hint">支持字节数或 K/KB/M/MB 单位；超出安全范围会自动限制。默认值适合大多数连接，高带宽可增大 packetUp/packetDown，高延迟可保持 connectRace=2。</div>
    </div>
